Frame:
Another website embedded in the a webpage

Handle the Frame:
- First identify the frame which the element is present that needs to be accessed.
- Switch to the frame and find the element
- come out of the page

Syntax:

x--> ID of the frame
x--> name of the frame
x--> index (prefer when only single frame available )
x--> WebElement(find the element and pass as webelement)

d.switchTo().frame(x);
d.switchTo().defaultContent(); -----> One time decalre For inner frames : frame1-> frame2->default content ->main page